MOVA inference-only import patch
================================

The pinned upstream pipeline package initializer imports MOVA's training and
LoRA modules eagerly. That makes the documented inference runner fail on a
clean `pip install .` because the training-only bitsandbytes dependency is not
installed. The build verifies the exact upstream initializer SHA-256 and then
exports only the MOVA inference class. No inference implementation is changed.

Upstream source: https://github.com/OpenMOSS/MOVA/blob/1591b2557b42030a3421442c998dd6f5602ed9bd/mova/diffusion/pipelines/__init__.py
Upstream issue boundary: https://github.com/OpenMOSS/MOVA/blob/1591b2557b42030a3421442c998dd6f5602ed9bd/pyproject.toml
